dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">2.1 kW</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This helps set expectations for shower and bath availability through the day.</p></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--hot_water_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-hot_water_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">How your cylinder stores hot water</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Your cylinder mixes hot water throughout its volume.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This helps set expectations for shower and bath availability through the day.</p></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--timeline_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-timeline_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">Hot water timeline</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Key moments from the hot-water recovery timeline.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><section class="cprv1-timeline" data-testid="cprv1-timeline"><p class="cprv1-timeline__heading">Timeline summary</p><ol class="cprv1-timeline__list"><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">5m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Cylinder recovering</