t class="cprv1-metrics__label">Efficiency evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Fallback/static-return use: not present.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This highlights where steady operation can help reduce energy waste.</p></article></div></section><section class="cprv1-section" data-testid="cprv1-section-confidence_and_assumptions" aria-labelledby="cprv1-section-heading-confidence_and_assumptions"><header class="cprv1-section__header"><p class="cprv1-section__eyebrow">Section 7</p><h2 id="cprv1-section-heading-confidence_and_assumptions" class="cprv1-section__heading">How certain each part is</h2><p class="cprv1-section__summary">We separate what we measured, what we estimated, and what still needs installer confirmation.</p></header><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--confidence_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-confidence_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">What we measured</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">These details were measured on site or taken from confirmed manufacturer records.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">heatSourceModelData</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Manufacturer data</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This shows which details are confirmed and which are still estimated.</p></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--assumption_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-assumption_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">What we estimated</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">1 assumption was used where full access or data was not available.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Assumption</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Pipe route not fully confirmed</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This marks details that are finalised during the installation visit.</p></article></div></section><section class="cprv1-section" data-testid="cprv1-section-engineer_confirmation" aria-labelledby="cprv1-section-heading-engineer_confirmation"><header class="cprv1-section__header"><p class="cprv1-section__eyebrow">Section 8</p><h2 id="cprv1-section-heading-engineer_confirmation" class="cprv1-section__heading">What the installer will confirm</h2><p class="cprv1-section__summary">Routine on-site checks that finalise settings and verify any remaining unknowns.</p></header><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--assumption_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-assumption_stor