ariant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Heat source evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Heat source fired: none observed.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Heat source evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Heat source held off: 60s–1800s.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></dd></div></dl></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--warning_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-warning_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">Points to keep in mind</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">The following observations have been noted from the system assessment.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><ul class="cprv1-warning-list" data-testid="cprv1-card-warnings"><li class="cprv1-warning-chip cprv1-warning-chip--info" data-severity="info" data-category="efficiency"><span class="cprv1-warning-chip__severity">info</span><span>Efficiency estimates are based on system layout — actual performance may vary during the first heating season.</span></li><li class="cprv1-warning-chip cprv1-warning-chip--info" data-severity="info" data-category="hydraulic_risk"><span class="cprv1-warning-chip__severity">info</span><span>Circulation flow estimates use standard assumptions — your en