ting responds through the day.</p></header><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--thermal_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-thermal_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">How your heating performs day to day</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Room temperature start/end: 18.00°C -&gt; 18.12°C.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Return temperature evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Return temperature range: 53.67°C to 63.67°C.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Return temperature evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Runtime return telemetry available: yes.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Condensing efficiency evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Condensing-likely periods: 60s–60s.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This indicates how quickly rooms can warm up when your thermostat calls for heat.</p></article></div></section><section class="cprv1-section" data-testid="cprv1-section-hot_water_behaviour" aria-labelledby="cprv1-section-heading-hot_water_behaviour"><header class="cprv1-section__header"><p class="cprv1-section__eyebrow">Section 4</p><h2 id="cprv1-section-heading-hot_water_behaviour" class="cprv1-section__heading">How your hot water runs</h2><p class="cprv1-section__summary">Evidence from Atlas simulations showing expected hot water use and recovery.</p></header><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--hot_water_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-hot_water_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">How your hot water performs</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Stored DHW temperature start/end: 45.20°C -&gt; 43.03°C.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Shower availability</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">4 minutes</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Bath fill capacity</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">150 litres at 40°C</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Recovery rate</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">2.1 kW</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This helps set expectations for shower and bath availability through the day.</p></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--hot_water_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-hot_water_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">How your cylinder stores hot water</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Your cylinder mixes hot water throughout its volume.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This helps set expectations for shower and bath availability through the day.</p></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--timeline_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-timeline_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">Hot water timeline</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Key moments from the hot-water recovery timeline.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--estimated" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="estimated">Estimated from the visible system layout</span></header><section class="cprv1-timeline" data-testid="cprv1-timeline"><p class="cprv1-timeline__heading">Timeline summary</p><ol class="cprv1-timeline__list"><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">5m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Cylinder recovering</p><p class="cprv1-timeline__description">Cylinder recovering after hot water usage.</p></div></li><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">10m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Cylinder recovering</p><p class="cprv1-timeline__description">Cylinder recovering after hot water usage.</p></div></li><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">15m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Hot water in use</p><p class="cprv1-timeline__description">Hot water is being drawn off from the cylinder.</p></div></li><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">20m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Cylinder recovering</p><p class="cprv1-timeline__description">Cylinder recovering after hot water usage.</p></div></li><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">25m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Cylinder recovering</p><p class="cprv1-timeline__description">Cylinder recovering after hot water usage.</p></div></li><li class="cprv1-timeline__item" data-testid="cprv1-timeline-entry"><span class="cprv1-timeline__offset">30m</span><div class="cprv1-timeline__content"><p class="cprv1-timeline__label">Cylinder recovering</p><p class="cprv1-timeline__description">Cylinder recovering after hot water usage.</p></div></li></ol></section></article></div></section><section class="cprv1-section" data-testid="cprv1-section-comfort_expectations" aria-labelledby="cprv1-section-heading-comfort_expectations"><header class="cprv1-section__header"><p class="cprv1-section__eyebrow">Section 5</p><h2 id="cprv1-section-heading-comfort_expectations" class="cprv1-section__heading">What comfort to expect</h2><p class="cprv1-section__summary">What this setup means for warmth, heat-up speed, and day-to-day comfort in your rooms.</p></header><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--comfort_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-comfort_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">What comfort to expect</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Room temperature start/end: 18.00°C -&gt; 18.12°C.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Room comfort evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Room temperature min/max: 18.00°C / 18.12°C.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Room comfort evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Room approached target: no.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This shows what room comfort and response time are likely to feel like at home.</p></article></div></section><section class="cprv1-section" data-testid="cprv1-section-energy_efficiency" aria-labelledby="cprv1-section-heading-energy_efficiency"><header class="cprv1-section__header"><p class="cprv1-section__eyebrow">Section 6</p><h2 id="cprv1-section-heading-energy_efficiency" class="cprv1-section__heading">Energy use and efficiency</h2><p class="cprv1-section__summary">Evidence on how efficiently your system can run based on layout and simulation outputs.</p></header><ul class="cprv1-warning-list" data-testid="cprv1-section-warnings"><li class="cprv1-warning-chip cprv1-warning-chip--info" data-severity="info" data-category="efficiency"><span class="cprv1-warning-chip__severity">info</span><span>Efficiency estimates are based on system layout — actual performance may vary during the first heating season.</span></li></ul><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--efficiency_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-efficiency_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">How efficiently your system can run</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">Heat source fired: 60s–1800s.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Efficiency evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Condensing-likely periods: 60s–60s.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Efficiency evidence</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Fallback/static-return use: not present.</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This highlights where steady operation can help reduce energy waste.</p></article></div></section><section class="cprv1-section" data-testid="cprv1-section-confidence_and_assumptions" aria-labelledby="cprv1-section-heading-confidence_and_assumptions"><header class="cprv1-section__header"><p class="cprv1-section__eyebrow">Section 7</p><h2 id="cprv1-section-heading-confidence_and_assumptions" class="cprv1-section__heading">How certain each part is</h2><p class="cprv1-section__summary">We separate what we measured, what we estimated, and what still needs installer confirmation.</p></header><div class="cprv1-card-grid" data-layout="responsive-metric-cards"><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--confidence_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-confidence_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">What we measured</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">These details were measured on site or taken from confirmed manufacturer records.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">heatSourceModelData</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Manufacturer data</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">pressureRegime</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Manufacturer data</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--manufacturer" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="manufacturer">Based on manufacturer information</span></dd></div></dl><p class="cprv1-card__implication" data-testid="cprv1-card-implication"><strong>What this means for you:</strong> This shows which details are confirmed and which are still estimated.</p></article><article class="cprv1-card cprv1-card--assumption_story" data-testid="cprv1-card-assumption_story"><header class="cprv1-card__header"><div><h3 class="cprv1-card__title">What we estimated</h3><p class="cprv1-card__summary">16 assumptions were used where full access or data was not available.</p></div><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></header><dl class="cprv1-metrics" data-testid="cprv1-card-metrics"><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Assumption</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Pipe route not fully confirmed</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Assumption</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Pipe route not fully confirmed</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Assumption</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Pipe route not fully confirmed</dd><dd class="cprv1-metrics__confidence"><span class="cprv1-confidence-badge cprv1-confidence-badge--assumed" data-testid="cprv1-confidence-badge" data-variant="assumed">Pipe route not fully confirmed</span></dd></div><div class="cprv1-metrics__item"><dt class="cprv1-metrics__label">Assumption</dt><dd class="cprv1-metrics__value">Pipe route not fully confirmed</dd><dd class="cp